{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 11, :comments ["<b>Among the mighty.</b> Among the strong, as in ״וְאֶת אֵילֵי הָאָרֶץ לָקָח״ (Ezekiel 17). ״אֱיָלוּתִי לְעֶזְרָתִי חוּשָׁה״ (Psalms 22)." "<b>Awesome in praise.</b> Fitting to be silent [rather] than to tell Your praises, lest they be diminished, as written ״לְךָ דוּמִיָּה תְהִלָּה״ (Psalms 65:2)."], :book :exodus, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 15, :notes {}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T08:52:23.759461629Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}